* stata.toc
*
* Stata package directory file for the litdiscover repository.
* Read by `net from` and used to drive the package-description page
* shown to a user installing from this repository over HTTP.
* See [R] net for the file format specification.

v 3
d litdiscover -- A Stata package for theory-aware literature review and discovery
d
d litdiscover combines latent Dirichlet allocation (LDA) topic
d modelling of abstract text with a deductive overlay of the researcher-
d coded construct fields (theory, dependent variable, independent
d variable, moderator, mediator, decision, context, method, journal,
d year). It produces topic-by-field cross-tabulations, TCCM and ADO
d framework outputs, network-analytic measures over construct co-
d occurrences, FREX exclusivity scores, per-topic stability
d diagnostics, UMass coherence, and static and interactive
d visualisations.
d
d Author: Nebojsa S. Davcik, EM Normandie Business School, Oxford, UK.
d Email: davcik@live.com
d ORCID: 0000-0003-1041-8788
d
d Licence: GPL-3.0-or-later
d Repository: https://github.com/Davcik/litdiscover

p litdiscover  litdiscover 1.0 (LDA topic modelling with deductive construct extraction)
